        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7036/N, 4-1/2 Inch Rectangular Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4-1/2 Inch Pocket Door Passage Set comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it on both sides of a single door: 2 passage flush pulls and a passage mortise box with built in finger pull to get the door from the pocket. 4-1/2 Inch Rectangular Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware is available in  many finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Lock:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/4-1-2-inch-rectangular-flush-pull-omnia-7036-0\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/4-1-2-inch-pocket-door-privacy-set-omnia-7036-l\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 7036 Pocket Door Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Case: Stamped from heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Front: Armored steel front adjustable for beveled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortises faceplate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Passage Modern Rectangular Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lockbody Box Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lockbody Box Depth: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lockbody Faceplate Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lockbody Faceplate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 1/2\" thick x 1-1/4\" high x 1\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Finger Pull: 1/2\" thick x 2\" high x 1-1/4\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-7036-specifications.pdf?v=1704262370\"><b>Omnia 7036 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a passage mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
